OL,3,GNEWSANI health trusts to announce 12%
OL,4,Asavings plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's health and social
OL,7,Fcare trusts are expected to announce
OL,8,Fproposals on how they intend to make
OL,9,Fsavings of up to 12%, spread over three
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FAt the moment, health faces a funding
OL,13,Fgap of #800m.
OL,15,FHealth unions have told BBC News NI
OL,16,Fthey understand jobs will be affected
OL,17,Fas the trusts attempt to make the
OL,18,Fsavings. Those posts could include
OL,19,Fporter and cleaning posts.
OL,21,FUnions are planning to protest later
OL,22,Fthis morning.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
